  "notes": "USAGE:\nA formal word most commonly seen in resumes, official documents, surveys, and news articles. In everyday conversation, {働|はたら}く or {仕事|しごと}をする is more natural. Almost always used with the particle に: Xに{従事|じゅうじ}する.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {農業|のうぎょう}に{従事|じゅうじ}する: to be engaged in agriculture\n- {研究|けんきゅう}に{従事|じゅうじ}する: to be engaged in research\n- {業務|ぎょうむ}に{従事|じゅうじ}する: to be engaged in duties\n- {従事|じゅうじ}{者|しゃ}: worker, person engaged in",
